    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n19629" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">glārĕa</span></b> , ae,
			f., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>gravel</i> (cf. arena, sabulum, suburra, rudus): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eo loco pulvis, non glarea injecta est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic. Q. Fr. 3, 2, 2, § 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 9, 2</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vias glareà substruendas locaverunt,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Liv.
					41, 27, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 4, 22, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 1, 7,
				59</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 2, 212</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vitr. 2, 4,
				2</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Job, 30,
		6</span></i>.</div>
